{"type":"message","id":"060fface","parentId":"08ecaa1f","timestamp":"2026-05-15T21:55:24.523Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Friday, May 15th, 2026 - 9:55 PM (UTC) / 2026-05-15 21:55 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778882124437}}
{"type":"message","id":"740d801a","parentId":"060fface","timestamp":"2026-05-15T21:55:32.569Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform by fetching the history for both the arbitration and general threads.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-01b0c628-8b4d-4bf3-81cc-9d9945f44de4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-98fa43fd-7f45-46b7-805a-3ee3d61ecda1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":146,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11269,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778882124524,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a65d76ee-123b-4ae4-ba49-e60a940042d9"}}
